:: Reflection Questions {"position":"425,725","size":"100,100"}
## Reflection Questions

Try to think of the type of sexism before revealing the answer.

a) A new virtual reality headset is out that is too big for most women to see properly through the lens. (link-reveal: "What type of sexism could this be?")[
Sexism in Design]

b) Despite high technological abilities, the manager consistently asks Jen to take notes because her writing is so neat. What type of sexism could this be? (link-reveal: "What type of sexism could this be?")[ 
Personal sexism]

c) A studio head says that they don't like women main characters in their video games because they do not usually sell well and it's too much of a risk to make one. What type of sexism could this be? (link-reveal: "What type of sexism could this be?")[
Institutional sexism]

d) Only men may use the latest cutting-edge virtual reality flight simulator due to the g-forces being hypothesized to be too intense for women? (link-reveal: "What type of sexism could this be?")[
Sexism in Design]

